  "journal": {
    "s18_journal": {
      "title": "The Sealed Chamber",
      "text": "The kingdoms dug beneath the monument together. We shored up the old supports, rebuilt the fallen steps and took the first research team down. At the bottom was a hall the Builders left: copper channels that hummed when we gave them their hearts, a clock that has never moved, two circles carved exactly alike, and another warning. The door's carving gave the order of the six lock stones, and the door sank away. Behind it is a chamber with a great stone ring standing over a chasm. The compass points straight at it. Orin says nobody touches anything."
    }
  }
